{'symbol': 'FDS', 'date': '2023-01-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'LIGHTPOINT FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY AND FACTSET COLLABORATE TO PROVIDE GREATER DATA FLEXIBILITY', 'text': 'JOINT SOLUTION OFFERS HEDGE FUNDS, INSTITUTIONAL ASSET MANAGERS, AND FAMILY OFFICES GREATER DATA FLEXIBILITY TO COMPLEMENT INDIVIDUAL INVESTMENT NEEDS NEW YORK , JAN. 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LIGHTPOINT FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY ("LIGHTPOINT") AND FACTSET, A GLOBAL FINANCIAL DIGITAL PLATFORM AND ENTERPRISE SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, ARE COLLABORATING TO OFFER HEDGE FUNDS, INSTITUTIONAL ASSET MANAGERS, AND FAMILY OFFICES A FULLY INTEGRATED FRONT-TO-BACK SOLUTION WITH GREATER DATA FLEXIBILITY. BY COMBINING LIGHTPOINT\'S PORTFOLIO, ORDER, AND EXECUTION MANAGEMENT SYSTEM (POEMS) WITH FACTSET\'S DATA SOLUTION, INVESTMENT MANAGERS CAN REIMAGINE THEIR TRADE AND ORDER WORKFLOWS AND IMPROVE ON OPERATIONAL EFFICIENCIES WHEN EVALUATING OR EXECUTING ON TRADING OPPORTUNITIES.'}